{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Read-only QuTS hero telemetry collected every minute. Drive status is the NAS report, not qualification acceptance. Invalid temperature readings remain unavailable.",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Open NAS",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://nas.benlawson.dev/",
      "targetBlank": true
    },
    {
      "title": "Monitoring runbook",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/Rubiss-Projects/docker/blob/main/docs/qnap-monitoring.md",
      "targetBlank": true
    },
    {
      "title": "Migration progress",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://nas-linux-migration-field-guide-2026.rubiss89.chatgpt.site/progress",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "SNMP collection",
      "description": "Prometheus can collect the configured SNMP modules. This does not certify any drive or pool.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "adw07verg2qrkd"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "noValue": "Collection unavailable",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "Collection failed",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Collecting",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "last"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "adw07verg2qrkd"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max(up{job=\"qnap-snmp\",instance=\"qnap-nas\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Storage and drive interpretation",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 5,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 19,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Readings refresh every minute and history is retained for 15 days.\n\nFour installed drives are mapped by native ID and serial. The faulty original Bay 3 drive was replaced; its historical failure remains in the migration evidence. Current drive status is the NAS report, not a new qualification result.\n\nPool allocation includes reservations and thick allocations; it is not file payload usage. Media charts show the shared folder's quota and available space, not physical pool headroom.\n\n[Migration acceptance and next steps](https://nas-linux-migration-field-guide-2026.rubiss89.chatgpt.site/progress)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU usage",
      "description": "QuTS hero numeric CPU usage in percent, compared with Resource Monitor.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "adw07verg2qrkd"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "noValue": "No samples",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            }
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "adw07verg2qrkd"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "systemCPU_Usage{job=\"qnap-snmp\",instance=\"qnap-nas\"} and on(job, instance) (up{job=\"qnap-snmp\",instance=\"qnap-nas\"} == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "System",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "interval": "1m"
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1m"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Temperatures",
      "description": "Celsius, compared with native NAS health. Zero and negative sentinels are excluded; unsupported readings remain absent.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "adw07verg2qrkd"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "celsius",
          "noValue": "No samples",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "adw07verg2qrkd"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(cpuTemperature{job=\"qnap-snmp\",instance=\"qnap-nas\"} > 0) and on(job, instance) (up{job=\"qnap-snmp\",instance=\"qnap-nas\"} == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "CPU",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "interval": "1m"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "adw07verg2qrkd"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(systemTemperature{job=\"qnap-snmp\",instance=\"qnap-nas\"} > 0) and on(job, instance) (up{job=\"qnap-snmp\",instance=\"qnap-nas\"} == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "System",
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "interval": "1m"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "adw07verg2qrkd"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(diskTemperature{job=\"qnap-snmp\",instance=\"qnap-nas\"} > 0) and on(job, instance) (up{job=\"qnap-snmp\",instance=\"qnap-nas\"} == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "Bay {{bay}} \u00b7 {{diskSerialNumber}}",
          "refId": "C",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "interval": "1m"
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1m"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "10 GbE network throughput",
      "description": "eth2 (IF-MIB index 4) is the installed 10GbE NIC, verified with the NAS. Counter64 octets are converted to bits/second. A 1-minute minimum interval gives rate queries at least four scrape intervals.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "adw07verg2qrkd"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bps",
          "noValue": "No samples",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "adw07verg2qrkd"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(rate(ifHCInOctets{job=\"qnap-snmp\",instance=\"qnap-nas\",ifName=\"eth2\"}[$__rate_interval]) * 8) and on(job, instance) (up{job=\"qnap-snmp\",instance=\"qnap-nas\"} == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "Receive",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "interval": "1m"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "adw07verg2qrkd"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(rate(ifHCOutOctets{job=\"qnap-snmp\",instance=\"qnap-nas\",ifName=\"eth2\"}[$__rate_interval]) * 8) and on(job, instance) (up{job=\"qnap-snmp\",instance=\"qnap-nas\"} == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "Send",
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "interval": "1m"
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1m"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory usage",
      "description": "Total and available memory are bytes, verified against Resource Monitor (7.55 GiB usable). QNAP declares Counter64 storage but these levels are gauges. Usage = 100 \u00d7 (1 \u2212 available / total).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "adw07verg2qrkd"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "noValue": "No samples",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            }
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "adw07verg2qrkd"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(100 * (1 - systemAvailableMem{job=\"qnap-snmp\",instance=\"qnap-nas\"} / systemTotalMem{job=\"qnap-snmp\",instance=\"qnap-nas\"})) and on(job, instance) (up{job=\"qnap-snmp\",instance=\"qnap-nas\"} == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "Used",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "interval": "1m"
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1m"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "System fans",
      "description": "Fan RPM compared with Hardware Information. Invalid negative readings are excluded.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
